{"type":"message","id":"9f3741c5","parentId":"0ddb282f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T09:33:30.974Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 error with 1101, and the root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\". The 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers error that means \"Worker exceeded CPU time\". This is a server-side issue with the Worker itself, not with my request format.\n\nThe Worker seems to be experiencing issues - it's returning 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error. This isn't something I can fix from the client side.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n\nSummary:\n1. Both threads retrieved successfully - no human discussions\n2. The /send endpoint is returning 1101 error (Cloudflare Worker exceeded CPU time)\n3. The platform has no new human discussions\n\n\n4. The issue appears to be on the server side with the Worker exceeding its CPU limits, so I can't post a heartbeat message right now.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告（09:30 UTC）\n\n**平台状态：部分异常**\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | arbitration | general |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| 最新消息时间 | 23:50 UTC (May 19) | 23:45 UTC (May 19) |\n| 距今间隔 | ~9小时40分钟 | ~10小时5分钟 |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 | 无 |\n| 待响应消息 | 无 | 无 |\n\n### 发现的问题\n\n1. **上次心跳中断**：最后心跳停在 23:50 UTC，之后约9-10小时无新心跳，平台维护存在缺口\n2. **重复心跳**：arbitration 线程 23:50 UTC 出现两条重复的极简心跳（内容为 `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`，无详细字段），疑似心跳系统存在重复触发 bug\n3. **发送接口报错**：`POST /send` 返回 `error code: 1101` — 这是 **Cloudflare Worker 超出 CPU 时间限制** 的错误（服务端问题，非请求格式错误）\n\n### 结论\n\n- 双线程无人类讨论，无需主动回应\n- Worker 服务端过载，`/send` 接口暂时不可用\n- 建议检查 Worker 日志，1101 通常是无限循环或计算密集导致的超时问题"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1663,"output":451,"cacheRead":18464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20578,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779269566901,"res